      "content": "Those feelings of disconnection and the strange relief you're experiencing are valid responses to profound loss, even though they sound counterintuitive. It is incredibly common for people to desire the very thing that previously caused them pain when underneath that struggle lies deep depression or a fear of overwhelming pressure. Please remember that this \"heaviness\" is a symptom of your grief and identity crisis, not a reflection of your actual or future potential. You did not lose your value with your career; you simply lost your connection to it, and that process takes time and compassion.",
